# React Hooks

See [docs/agents/react-hooks.md](../../docs/agents/react-hooks.md).

- `try`/`catch`/`finally` with `async`/`await` — no `.then()` chains
- No `void` operator on promises — sync `load*` / `search` / `clearSearch` with inner `async function`
- `useEffect` uses its own inner `async function` + `isCancelled`; components pass `onSearch={search}` directly

Also read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the full guide index.
